 maps, for when you just want a single match Early Access also adds 13 Steam achievements. Play the free demo now You don't have to wait until November. The free demo is on Steam right now. It includes the prologue and two Challenge Path missions,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:18:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769560-1846651706675503","game_id":"steam-4769560","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: 13 languages, a new menu and a look at what's coming","summary":"Steam Next Fest starts on October 19, and the free demo has just been updated ahead of the festival. Many of these changes come straight from your feedback. Thank you to everyone who played, filled in the survey or wrote to me. What's new in the demo 13 languages. English, Polish, German, French, Spanish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Turkish, Brazilian Portuguese, Italian and Czech. New single-player menu, and all windows now share one consistent style. Refreshed visuals: new l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T20:09:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675503","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769560-1844115010488497","game_id":"steam-4769560","kind":"announcement","title":"The First Ironholm Videos Are Live on YouTube!","summary":"The first YouTube videos featuring the Ironholm demo are now live!It’s really exciting to see other people playing the game, sharing their thoughts and pointing out things that can still be improved.I’m back from vacation now and I’ve already started going through all the feedback from the demo. I’m collecting everything, fixing issues and working on improvements based on what players and creators have shared so far.If you want to see what others think about Ironholm, you can check out the first","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T08:47:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488497","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769560-1842846814440817","game_id":"steam-4769560","kind":"announcement","title":"The Ironholm Public Demo Is Now Live","summary":"The first public demo of Ironholm is now available on Steam.This is a big milestone for me as a solo developer, and I’m really excited to finally let everyone try the game.The demo includes the first 3 missions and introduces the core gameplay of Ironholm.Your feedback mattersIronholm is still in development, so your feedback is especially valuable at this stage.If you play the demo, please let me know what you think:What works well?What feels confusing?What would you like to see improved?You ca","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T15:47:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769560-1841579228668429","game_id":"steam-4769560","kind":"announcement","title":"New Units, New Buildings & Demo Coming Soon","summary":"Hi everyone!Ironholm has changed a lot over the past few weeks.After updating the natural environment, I turned my attention to two of the most important visual parts of the game: units and buildings.New Unit ModelsThe old low-poly soldiers have been now completely replaced with new models.Swordsmen and archers have received a new look that fits the visual direction of Ironholm much better and makes battles feel more detailed and cohesive.All Buildings ReworkedThe units aren't the only thing tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T11:30:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668429","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769560-1837955055360770","game_id":"steam-4769560","kind":"update","title":"Nature Visual Update","summary":"Hi everyone!Based on your feedback, I made a visual update to the nature on the map.The old vegetation felt too simple and too static, so I replaced it with new trees, grass, bushes, flowers, rocks, and small details. Plants now also have subtle movement, which makes the world feel much more alive.You can see the full visual update in this video:Thanks for the feedback and following the development of Ironholm!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T09:15:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360770","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4769560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4769560":"2026-10-26T14:07:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4769560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:43Z"},"5173420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:44Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4769560","app_id":4769560,"app_scope":"ba